=== obj-attribute-set-value-array
from: DB::Xoos 0.1.1 lib/DB/Xoos/Model.pm6:22
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method set_value
--- code
my class Model {
    has @.columns;
    method set-columns(*@columns) {
        my $attr = self.^attributes.first: { $_.Str eq ('@.columns'|'@!columns') };
